<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 250>><<link "垫资奉上新袍 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<money -250>><<replace "#mp-job-spa-enc5">>
你当即垫出两镑半押金，从前台取出专供贵宾的全新云锦浴袍双手奉上，又承诺将勾丝的旧袍送去高街裁缝铺免费精修。维奥拉夫人见你行事爽利，不仅补还了押金，还多赏了一笔体己钱。<span class="green">大方得体的处置保住了私汤的招牌。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 640>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">垫资奉上新袍 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
